1. Create a question in question bank

POST /api/v1/questionnaire-surveys/questions

Description

Create a new question in the questionnaire question bank.

Auth

Admin only

Request Body
{
  "questionText": "Committee members actively participate in decision-making.",
  "category": "participation"
}
Success Response

201 Created

{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Question created successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": "uuid",
    "questionText": "Committee members actively participate in decision-making.",
    "category": "participation",
    "isActive": true,
    "createdAt": "2026-04-08T10:00:00Z"
  }
}
Error Response

400 Bad Request

{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "details": {
    "questionText": "This field is required"
  }
}
2. Get all active questions

GET /api/v1/questionnaire-surveys/questions

Description

Retrieve all active questions from the question bank.

Success Response

200 OK

{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Questions retrieved successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid-1",
      "questionText": "Committee members actively participate in decision-making.",
      "category": "participation",
      "isActive": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-04-08T10:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
3. Create a questionnaire survey

POST /api/v1/questionnaire-surveys

Description

Create a questionnaire survey using selected question bank items.

Auth

Admin only

Request Body
{
  "title": "CRC Governance Assessment",
  "description": "Questionnaire survey for governance effectiveness",
  "questionIds": [
    "question-bank-uuid-1",
    "question-bank-uuid-2",
    "question-bank-uuid-3"
  ]
}
Success Response

201 Created

{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Questionnaire survey created successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": "survey-uuid",
    "title": "CRC Governance Assessment",
    "description": "Questionnaire survey for governance effectiveness",
    "isActive": true,
    "createdAt": "2026-04-08T10:00:00Z",
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": "survey-question-uuid-1",
        "surveyId": "survey-uuid",
        "questionBankId": "question-bank-uuid-1",
        "questionText": "Committee members actively participate in decision-making.",
        "category": "participation",
        "questionOrder": 1,
        "isRequired": true,
        "scaleOptions": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]
      }
    ]
  }
}
Error Response

400 Bad Request

{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "details": {
    "questionIds": "At least one question is required"
  }
}
