6. Submit questionnaire responses

POST /api/v1/questionnaire-surveys/<survey_id>/responses

Description

Submit responses for one questionnaire survey. Each question uses a fixed 1–7 scale.

Request Body
{
  "respondentName": "Alice",
  "respondentEmail": "alice@example.com",
  "answers": [
    {
      "surveyQuestionId": "survey-question-uuid-1",
      "score": 6
    },
    {
      "surveyQuestionId": "survey-question-uuid-2",
      "score": 7
    }
  ]
}
Success Response

201 Created

{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Responses submitted successfully",
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "response-uuid-1",
      "surveyId": "survey-uuid",
      "surveyQuestionId": "survey-question-uuid-1",
      "score": 6,
      "respondentName": "Alice",
      "respondentEmail": "alice@example.com",
      "submittedAt": "2026-04-08T10:10:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
Error Response

400 Bad Request

{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "details": {
    "score": "Score must be an integer between 1 and 7"
  }
}

404 Not Found

{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Questionnaire survey not found"
}
